// REJECTS: Unexpected token
//
// A Pure instance class mapping is `(~src | ~filter)* (propertyMapping (, propertyMapping)*)?`.
// The source and filter clauses form a prefix; once a property mapping has been read, no
// ~src may follow.
//
// Property mappings here are separated by COMMAS and the clauses are not, which is the tell
// -- but a rewrite that reads the body as a comma-free sequence of "clause or mapping" gets
// a parser that accepts ~src anywhere, including between two property mappings. Hoisting
// the ~src above the property makes this parse.
###Mapping
Mapping fixture::neg::SrcAfterProperty
(
   fixture::neg::Person: Pure
   {
      firstName: $src.first,
      ~src fixture::neg::SrcPerson
   }
)
